=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play config/menu ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Configuration screen (pkg/screens/config),$
# proposed with no Figma frame, on a hardn.yml loaded by the$
# real loader (pkg/config) from a simulated host. Edit a setting$
# saves one key to that host's file through the real engine.$
# Nothing on this machine changes or is read.$
$
# Info: config/menu$
# Main menu 8: hardn.yml, DNS Settings, NTP Settings and Syslog$
# Settings. It reads nothing.$
$
# Configuration ################################################$
$
   1) hardn.yml            View or edit the file hardn reads$
   2) DNS Settings         Configure nameservers$
   3) NTP Settings         Keep the clock in sync$
   4) Syslog Settings      Send logs to a syslog server$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-4 or q]: q$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

